# --- Heavy / non-versioned artifacts (see docs/CHANGELOG_metodologico.md) ---
# Raw and derived data never live in this repo. They live in the documented
# Drive storage location. This section exists as a safety net, not as the
# primary control (the primary control is: never point outputs at this repo).
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
data/
datasets/
crops/
synth/
runs/
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Generated results that are NOT the canonical consolidated output ---
# Canonical consolidated CSV/Parquet outputs are kept in results/ and ARE
# versioned deliberately (they are small and are the evidentiary basis of the
# paper's tables) -- everything else generated at run time is not.
*.log
tmp/
scratch/
